  "title": "NioCorp Launches Construction of Elk Creek Critical Minerals Project Mine Portal",
  "summary": "NioCorp Developments Ltd. (“NioCorp,” “our,” or the “Company”) (NASDAQ:NB), a leading U.S. critical minerals developer, today announced that construction of the main access to the underground portion of the Company’s Elk Creek Critical Minerals Project (the “Elk Creek Project”) in southeast Nebraska has now begun.",
